      en: ["Secures the northern coast of Santo Antão Island", "Located near the scenic mountain village of Fontainhas", "Designed to withstand extreme maritime weather conditions", "Key navigational aid for regional ship traffic", "Offers panoramic views over the Atlantic Ocean", "Accessible via challenging coastal hiking trails"],
